  "title": "Avi.Apps: Patient-centric data collection via integrated mobile applications",
  "summary": "Patient-centric data collection via integrated mobile applications not only provides patient reported outcome measures (PROMs), but will also enhance response authenticity, timeliness and trial compliance.Avi.Apps bespoke mobile solutions for use in-trial: • Customised: Data entry for every trail • White Label: Branded to fit within trial style guide • Push to Patient: Proactive push to patients to prompt data entry • Integrated: Data capture at patient location is fully integrated to data repos",
